      "ResourceName": null,
      "Children": [
        {
          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
          "Text": "This simulation shows how to enable and parameterise solute loss in runoff water. The _SoluteInRunoff_ manager script provides access to the parameters.\n\nThe _Runoff_ graph at the bottom of the simulation plots runoff on the left axis and the amount of NO3 in layers 1, 2 and 3 that is lost in the runoff water. Note that the amount of NO3 lost from layer 3 is zero. This is due to the parameterisation of the _SoluteInRunoff manager script.",
          "Name": "Memo",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [],
          "Enabled": true,
          "ReadOnly": false
        },
